{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id491753843"}, "name":{"label":"Someoneelseotherthanme"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-08T11:31:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8"}, "id":{"label":"11587383055"}, "title":{"label":"Mostly Positive Redesign Changes"}, "content":{"label":"Mostly a fan of the new update! Everything is very responsive now and loads much quicker. The \"Go back\" feature when you accidentally swipe the timeline is SO good, didn't know I needed that until now. (Also thanks for bringing back Tap to Play before I even complained about it lol.)\n\nThat all being said, I think the new design is a bit of a regression. It's not harder to find things per se, but the app lost a lot of its personality from the last update and doesn't look unique in any way. Also miss the swipable cards to get to the show notes and chapters :(", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
