{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id182960477"}, "name":{"label":"Graemeblake"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-04T20:21:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8"}, "id":{"label":"11573480904"}, "title":{"label":"Great app, nice update"}, "content":{"label":"Been using overcast for years. It’s fast, podcasts sound great, nice customization options per podcast for smart speed etc This is a big update that changed a lot. As a longtime user it was quite easy to figure out the new way of doing familiar actions. Really enjoying it, seamless transition. Everything runs smoothly The app’s creator has said that with this new update it’ll be way easier to add features so I’m excited to see what he comes up with.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
