{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id16857476"}, "name":{"label":"Filthyjasminetea"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-04T10:31:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8"}, "id":{"label":"11571990566"}, "title":{"label":"Update in 2024 is very poor"}, "content":{"label":"The recent update makes the app extremely slow and unreliable. Will be going to alternatives until fixed", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id116160782"}, "name":{"label":"Andrew8088"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-04T05:08:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8"}, "id":{"label":"11570952099"}, "title":{"label":"Best way to get podcasts"}, "content":{"label":"I've been using Overcast since its release 10 years ago, and it's always been one of my favourite apps! Easy to use, doesn't crash, and just the perfect amount of customizability.\n\nLove the SmartSpeed feature, and the intro/outro skipping options. Also, you can set custom speed (1x, 2x, etc) for each podcast.\n\nSmall nit: syncing episodes to my Apple Watch is a little slow. But I hear Marco is working on that soon. Thanks!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id439987879"}, "name":{"label":"babydad123"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-04T05:03:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8"}, "id":{"label":"11570937754"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing podcast app"}, "content":{"label":"Huge listener of podcasts and this app is perhaps the best designed and featureful podcast player out there. Recently rewritten and redesigned and is super fast.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id151751536"}, "name":{"label":"luma46"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-04T03:59:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8"}, "id":{"label":"11570767956"}, "title":{"label":"Latest version is worse than previous"}, "content":{"label":"Not sure why the developer change a good app to not so good. Menus are confusing and I cannot rearrange playing order…\n\nThe only extra thing I’d like to see is total unplayed minutes o top of total unplayed podcasts", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id20122096"}, "name":{"label":"User14784366"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-04T01:27:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8"}, "id":{"label":"11570397290"}, "title":{"label":"A mess… for now."}, "content":{"label":"Out of deference for the years of quality preceding the overhaul I’m going with four stars but, truth be told, it’s a two star experience at the moment. \n\nNew UI is a mixed bag to put it generously. It feels like screens now typically contain half as many options and half as much information, in keeping with the drastically dumbed down modern iPhone UI philosophy. Everything seems to take at least one extra tap to do. \n\nRegularly gets hung up on a syncing screen for several minutes. \n\nHopeful this app will be back in five star territory soon.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id70003558"}, "name":{"label":"MichaelGR"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-03T20:09:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8"}, "id":{"label":"11569678419"}, "title":{"label":"Good upgrade"}, "content":{"label":"Much faster than the old code base, which is great. My only wish would be for a faster way to go to a podcast’s archive of old episodes. It’s something I do a lot and it now takes a lot of steps.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
