{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id201425440"}, "name":{"label":"petergarner"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-02T06:06:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8"}, "id":{"label":"11563492257"}, "title":{"label":"Fantastic"}, "content":{"label":"Latest rewrite is not without its glitches, which is to be expected, but in my experience, this developer is extremely responsive and dedicated to making a great app. I’ve subscribed to Overcast for years, and I can’t imagine my iPhone without it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id23694533"}, "name":{"label":"Hunshine"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-01T18:15:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8"}, "id":{"label":"11561666900"}, "title":{"label":"Was a great app. Update ruined it for me."}, "content":{"label":"I have been using this app for many years. It was always 5 stars. It was the easiest and best podcast app that I had ever used.\n\nThis new update/app revamp has ruined all of that for me. It is now cluttered and confusing and you don’t have the option to show less of the clutter. \n\nOptions that I use often like sleep timer are buried. I press on info for a podcast episode, and it sticks with that podcast episode information even when trying to get another episodes info. \n\nI do feel bad writing this because it’s one guy that runs this app and it was so good for a decade, but I have to let it be known that this app and update really is a step backwards for this app. This whole app now seems like it lags and is buggy.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
