{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1165306222"}, "name":{"label":"MISSED _YOUR _QUEUE"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-31T04:09:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"11555360675"}, "title":{"label":"Stay away (for now)"}, "content":{"label":"Recent complete rewrite got rid of streaming.\n\nImagine?! A podcast app that doesn’t stream!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id11078924"}, "name":{"label":"Arnolfini"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-30T19:58:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"11554184523"}, "title":{"label":"The app sucks SO MUCH since the update."}, "content":{"label":"Removal of streaming option was a dealbreaker for me because I like to listen to podcasts during my ~40min subway commute. During that commute I typically have 2-3 bars of reception when I'm at a station and 0 when I'm between them. With 'streaming', the app would download a bit more of the episode every time I was at a station and keep on playing, so my listening would be uninterrupted for my whole journey. \n\nNow that the option has been removed, I have to remember to pre-download several episodes before heading down to the subway. Otherwise, if an episode ends when l'm between stations, I need to wait till I get to the next one before I can start downloading another episode. Given that my reception at stations isn't super strong, the downloads often don't finish before the train pulls away again which results in a failed download and I have to sit in silence and wait for the next station before I can try again. I can sometimes pass through 2 or 3 stations before an episode downloads successfully.\nIt's utterly destroyed the listening experience for me.\n\nOh, and playlists are all messed up. \n\nCancelled my Overcast subscription, deleted the app and started using Pocketcast instead which is vastly superior to this garbage fire of an update.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id103093909"}, "name":{"label":"umcam256"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-30T19:10:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"11554066028"}, "title":{"label":"Poor redesign"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using overcast for about a decade. The recent redesign is not user friendly. The sleep timer used to be easily accessible; located just below the play/rewind buttons. It’s now tucked away and you have to click multiple times to get to the sleep timer option. To navigate to the sleep timer menu, you have to click on an icon that doesn’t give you any indication what is hidden behind it. It controls multiple functions not just the sleep timer. As someone who frequently uses the sleep timer this is very frustrating and not user friendly.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
